WEBVTT

00:07:28.958 --> 00:07:30.684
EP: We look traditionally wrong.

00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:32.434
AG: We might be, but are you saying

00:07:32.458 --> 00:07:35.143
the CEO is the most powerless person
in the organization?

00:07:35.167 --> 00:07:37.143
EP: No, I don't think it's this or that.

00:07:37.167 --> 00:07:38.643
I think the CEO has both ends.

00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:40.393
AG: You always have these paradoxes

00:07:40.417 --> 00:07:42.643
and they drive me crazy
because I want answers.

00:07:42.667 --> 00:07:43.934
EP: Because --
(Laughter)

00:07:43.958 --> 00:07:45.476
AG: Wait, pause for a second.

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.101
EP: You want to simplify
and I want to hold complexity,

00:07:48.125 --> 00:07:50.934
but that's the difference
between a clinical psychologist

00:07:50.958 --> 00:07:52.684
and an organizational psychologist.

00:07:52.708 --> 00:07:56.268
AG: I thought that was the difference
between Americans and Europeans, OK.

00:07:56.292 --> 00:07:58.893
EP: As well, as well.
(Laughter)

00:07:58.917 --> 00:08:00.518
We can put that one in too.